erimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unique job identifier for polling status"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"model: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2387","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2387"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model used for generation"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"artifacts","text":"artifacts?","level":3},{"id":"jobid","text":"jobId","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2383](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2383)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nResult of creating a video generation job.\n\n Video generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Properties\n\n### artifacts?\n\n```ts\noptional artifacts?: PersistedArtifactRef[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2393](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2393)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nDurable artifact references, when generation persistence with an artifact +\nblob store is wired. A submission has no video yet, so this only carries\nrefs for persisted prompt INPUTS (e.g. a start frame).\n\n***\n\n### jobId\n\n```ts\njobId: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2385](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2385)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nUnique job identifier for polling status\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2387](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2387)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nModel used for generation\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: VideoJobResult\ntitle: VideoJobResult\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2383](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2383)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nResult of creating a video generation job.\n\n Video generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Properties\n\n### artifacts?\n\n```ts\noptional artifacts?: PersistedArtifactRef[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2393](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2393)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nDurable artifact references, when generation persistence with an artifact +\nblob store is wired. A submission has no video yet, so this only carries\nrefs for persisted prompt INPUTS (e.g. a start frame).\n\n***\n\n### jobId\n\n```ts\njobId: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2385](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2385)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nUnique job identifier for polling status\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2387](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2387)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nModel used for generation\n"}
